{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月曜日のRの法則生放送の時の楽屋での写真"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっさん（私立恵比寿中学の安本彩花ちゃん）\nに久しぶりに会ってめっちゃテンション上がった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好き〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋にいた女子6人ぐらいでくせの強いしりとりっていうなんか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癖のある言葉でしりとりをしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか聞かない言葉を聞けて\nみんなで「あーそれいいね！」って笑いながら本番直前まで楽しみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なっぺ（高砂ひなたちゃん）にアイスを食べる私を盗撮されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにRの収録に行ったら山口達也さんに\n「おっ！！まあや久しぶりだねー！よろしくっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと言っていただいて\n覚えてくださってたのと気遣いのできる素敵さに\nあ〜だからみんなに好かれるんだな〜と思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして生放送の日はスタジオに入ったらゲストに武井壮さんとおかずクラブさんがいて\n武井壮さんは私のこと知ってくださってて..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まる前に拳をガッチャンコして宜しくお願いしますをしてくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかパワーがその瞬間から漲ってきた感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかずクラブさんも凄く可愛らしくて\nずっと衣装どこのだろ〜とか気になっちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいい匂いがしたのはゲストの誰なんだろう？って思ってて\n分からないまま終わりましたよ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アールンと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日の夜はチームチューリップ(川後ちゃんは不在"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")\nで焼肉を食べに行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の話やこれからの話...\n久しぶりに集まれたので話がつきませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高のメンバーです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/17/0672749/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}